 tabular-nums\">4,257</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">6,423</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">255.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,237</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">128.5</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,773</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">70.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,310</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">71.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,032</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">50.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,115</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">35.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">70w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The AY Acrylic is a novel see-through case using plexiglass panels held together with corner nuts and screws. Available in clear, frosted, or black with floral cutouts and VESA bracket support. Requires careful handling due to acrylic fragility. Supports single-slot GPUs up to ~2-slot thickness (RTX 3050, ARC A380). Limited passive airflow with no official fan support on PSU side; dual 80mm fans possible on bottom without GPU. The 400w Flex-ATX PSU is adequate given the ~200w total system draw. Performance is good for light 1080p gaming and excellent for 720p-900p gaming. Ryzen 5 7600 pairs well with RTX 3050 for productivity and entry-level gaming. Case is simple to assemble and could accommodate medium-tier CPUs up to 105w with robust cooling. GPU limited to low-power single-slot options. AAA gaming at low settings is playable; ray tracing not recommended. Suitable for workstation use and esports titles at high settings.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">13,590</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:43%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->57<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">141.6</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">-1<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">128.5<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->67<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.84</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">2<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" 